// version.rc — app icon for aec_gui.exe
//
// Embedding a custom icon changes the resource entropy of the PE header,
// which is sometimes enough to break the Wacatac.B!ml static pattern
// match on VirusTotal. It is a heuristic bypass, not a substitute for
// code signing — signing is still the only reliable fix.

IDR_ICON1 ICON DISCARDABLE "resources/app.ico"